From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:52:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ReNova 0.1 on NOVA 6.5.5: version, About, help and credits

Version is '<renova>-nova<base>' (0.1-nova6.5.5); upgrade actions still
read the NOVA base. Settings get About/Help/Credits entries pointing to
the fork, the store rating prompt and the hardcoded upstream email for
library exports are gone.
